			"date": "2025-02-05T09:07:03.787Z",
			"content": "<p>Would this mean specifically polymorphic and server side JS/TS?</p>\n<p>As a person who likes to do easy MPAs with HTML, CSS and JSS and some bundling, this appears interesting on the surface but does not seem to affect so much web development and so feels like \"just interesting with ecosystem evolution\".</p>",
