				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:24la36c5vk45r2sc4xscsikr/bafkreicdkr7cmuzc7kxnnvjz5bpe5ws3wgbnr5jiczzih6dqeoeu6uncgq"
			},
			"date": "2025-02-07T09:18:26.273Z",
			"content": "<p>Its kind of a slippery slope of Node.js here (prompted by Deno / Bun). By supporting a non-standard file format rather than waiting for eg. <a href=\"https://github.com/tc39/proposal-type-annotations\">github.com/tc39/proposa...</a> they have opened themselves up to requests to support lots of other syntax.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
